00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.040
Huh, so this place is famous?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.080
Yep! All the guidebooks totally recommend it.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.790
All right then, let's eat!

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.130
Yum!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.790
That was totally in unison! Don't copy me.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.130
Right back atcha!

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.250
Oh my!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.170
What a couple with good chemistry!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.670
Oh, that's not it. Siblings, we're siblings.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:37.210
Is that so? You sure get along well.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.000
You there! Don't get embarrassed!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.170
Sorry...

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:45.290
Now then, shall we go take a look around at everything?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.790
