00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.670
DAIBUTSU

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.080
The sea breeze feels good!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.580
I almost feel like running
across the beach in my bare feet!

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.170
So why don't you go ahead and do it?

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:22.500
I'm not that childish, you know! My feet will get all sandy!

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:26.460
Then, maybe I'll go have some fun.
I'm still very much a child, so...

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:31.630
Is it bothering you, that I called you a child?

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.830
It's not as if I actually thought that.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:42.540
When I said that, I chose what I thought
would probably hurt you the most, Natsuo-kun.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:55.000
When it's like this, doesn't it feel
like time is going by very slowly?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.250
Can I ask you something
I've been wondering about for a while?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:01.880
Hmm?

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:09.670
Given the fact that your father got a divorce,
why did you do something like have an affair?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.920
When I think of Tsukiko-san's feelings, that's like...

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:23.580
I think I was just about your age, Natsuo-kun,
when I became acquainted with Shuu-san...

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.580
He was my first love, you see.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.130
He was...

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.250
my teacher.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.790
What?! For real?! Way to go!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.750
What's up?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:44.960
So Mami just happened to meet up with Shibata
on her way out, and they headed home together!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.420
Really?! That's great, Mami-chan!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.170
Was the conversation good?!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.250
It... It wasn't bad, I think...

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.330
You should ask him out to a movie or something!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:53.880
She's right!

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:54.630
Yeah!
She's right!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.710
Tachibana.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.250
Will you let me copy the English section of your notes?

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.460
What?! You reap what you sow.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:07.790
Don't say that! Oh God, oh Buddha, oh great Hina!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.750
Oh, all right!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.750
Thank you!

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.630
Hey, don't you think Hina gets all flirty?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:20.630
Oh‌, I was thinking that too! Isn't her attitude
different when she's like, talking to boys?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.960
Even though she knows that Mami likes Shibata.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.580
Wow, that's awful...!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.750
Or rather, Hina's really
not on the same wavelength as us.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:27.830
I get that!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:33.080
I wonder... Does she act like that
because she knows she's cute?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.710
Oh, I can see that.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.880
I mean, when it comes to being cute, she IS cute.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.750
But it's like, is she really THAT cute?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.630
Well, she is cuter than you.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.250
Hey! That hurts my feelings, you know.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:51.920
Are you by yourself?

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.920
I... I'm by myself...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.880
Then, is it okay if I eat with you?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.750
You're good at ventriloquism.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.210
Oh no, I'm not that good.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.420
That's not it! I'm actually talking for real!

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.500
Are you a second-year?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:17.460
Nice to meet you.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:21.960
Your bento looks yummy. It has quail eggs, my favorite.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.250
Now, now.

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:29.290
Sensei, is it okay if I come again tomorrow?

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.080
We're always open during breaks!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.210
Thank you very much

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.210
Farewell ceremony for transferring staff

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.540
After that, I bumped into him again by chance,
when I was a fourth-year in college...

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.880
It was a shock to me
when I saw a ring on his ring finger, but...

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:03.040
I couldn't win against my happiness
when he said that we should meet up again.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:09.670
I thought people who cheat or have affairs
were stupid, including my dad...

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.210
I thought they were the worst.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.580
That's what I thought...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.420
Can I really blame Sensei?

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.330
I blamed Sensei, and I criticized her...

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.210
But...

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.500
what if...

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.000
that had been me...?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.040
Sensei...

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.080
Hmm?

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:56.670
My novel is finished.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.750
A

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.750
Distant

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.750
Hand

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.710
The model for the heroine is you, Sensei.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.960
For the longest time, I...

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.880
have been in love with you, Sensei.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.540
As in romantically... right?

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:28.920
I see.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:34.500
Then, as a secret from Mom,
and Fujii-san, and even Rui...

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.750
shall we go out, the two of us?

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.380
What?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.540
Wait...! Wait, please!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:58.790
What's going on with you?!

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:03.380
For the two of us, this is what it means
to go out together, you know?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.790
We'll die together.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:06.880
What?

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.380
It's definitely something that we can't hide forever.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:16.670
If we were found out, then we'd have to throw away
everything, including our family and our place in society.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.500
That's the same as committing double suicide, isn't it?

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.330
Do you have the resolve to do that?

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.710
That's fine.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:38.830
When we get back to shore... let's go back
to being siblings that get along well, okay?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.170
Before that...

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:45.460
Is it okay if I ask you to grant me one last wish...?

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.170
Sensei...

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.880
Sensei...

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.130
We're home!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.290
Welcome home. Huh? What happened to your clothes?

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:18.710
When we were playing at the beach, we got drenched.
We bought these on the way home.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.830
Let me guess, Hina got all excited and pulled you in?

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.130
Natsuo-kun, sorry for that.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.750
Oh no... She did pay for my clothes after all...

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.580
Well, of course!

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.210
But it was fun, so...

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.130
Thank you

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.380
Thank you

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:46.710
Yes?

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.000
Can I come in?

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.540
Uh, hold on a sec...

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.630
Come in.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.330
What's up?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.580
Nothing. Nothing's up.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.750
May I sit down?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.170
Sure...

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:06.880
What're you reading?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.500
Huh? Oh, that?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.960
Marumi Sasaki's "The Mansion on the Cliff"
that I borrowed from the head of the club.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.420
Huh...

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.960
What? If you've got something to say, then say it.
I'm all curious now...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.630
When you come in here like you've got some reason,
but then you just hang out, it's kinda...

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.630
Wh-what...?!

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:31.670
I just felt like it...

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:39.170
That reminds me... That first day we met,
we didn't kiss, did we?

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:48.790
This may seem like weird logic,
but I kinda feel like kissing is special...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.290
Can we try it right now?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.080
Huh?!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:03.580
Wh-what're you saying?! What's up with you?!
You know we're family now!

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.130
And you even said to forget about that...

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.920
Then was Hina-nee special?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:09.500
What?!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.170
There was that time before
when you tried to kiss Hina-nee,

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.920
when she was sleeping on the sofa, remember?

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.500
Th-that was...

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:20.460
It was the first time I was going to be
living with a woman who was close to my age and...

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.130
I-I guess it was like, on impulse...

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:27.630
Anyway! We can't as siblings!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.170
Besides, what would everyone think,
if you and I had that kind of relationship...?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.790
That's the same as committing double suicide, isn't it?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.420
Actually...

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:50.790
All right... We can do it...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:20.920
I...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.880
think I might like it...

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.080
Huh?!

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:26.960
If it's just secretly kissing, is it okay
if we do it again some other time?

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.170
Wh-why...?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:34.670
I did it because I was wondering what it was like, but...

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.960
it's like, it makes me feel light and soft...

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.710
My uneasiness disappeared, as if it was never there...

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:44.580
I felt a sense of security? Or something like that.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.330
So...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.080
I thought it'd be good if you could feel that way, too.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.670
Well, good night...

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.210
Am I an idiot...?

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:13.960
Just because I want to reject what Sensei said
doesn't mean that I should...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.140
