00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.750
ANTHOLOGY

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.750
GARDEN

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.750
OF

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.750
LIGHT

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:46.790
I couldn't find it that last time,
but I looked for it afterwards and it turned up.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:50.960
The club publication! Last year's!
The one you said includes your work?

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.130
Yeah. The one I wrote for that was a romance, I think.

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:58.710
So, does that mean you don't always
write romances, Ashihara-san?

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:01.500
I've written on a lot of things in terms of short stories.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:04.750
Mysteries, science-fiction, yokai stories and...

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.790
Yokai stories?! Sounds interesting!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.290
I'm not confident that it's interesting, but...

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.580
A lot of times I was influenced by whatever book
I happened to be reading at the time, so...

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.710
Oh! There he is!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.330
Tachibana-san. Kashiwabara-san.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.540
By any chance, were you trying to be alone
with the head of the club?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.830
What?! No...!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.130
Don't you give me that look, too!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:30.580
Looks suspicious!

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:35.380
M-more importantly, shouldn't we be getting ready
for the club publication right about now?

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:38.380
Once summer break is over, the school cultural festival
will be here in a blink of an eye.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.250
Club publication?

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:43.210
Yeah. It's a booklet of collected works
by the club members that's put out at the cultural festival.

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:46.290
We should settle on a plan early,
so that there's writing time during summer break...

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.250
Oh.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.170
Is everyone here?

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:54.040
You've gathered on your own. It's almost like
you're starting to become real club members.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.670
We were talking about the club publication.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:58.580
I see. By the way, all of you...

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.460
While I admire that you are being constructive
about the production of the club publication,

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.880
are you sure about it right now?

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.500
It's almost time for final exams.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.080
That's right...!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:10.630
It appears that the finals this time for all subjects
will encompass a broad range.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.670
I ask that you keep things to a level that doesn't interfere
with your main occupation as students.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.920
And for that reason...

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.750
please help us with our test studying.

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:29.460
Um... Even though you've asked, for a teacher
you actually have to personally teach you is...

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.960
Please make it possible!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.170
Please make it possible!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:36.630
Well, I guess it can't be helped this time.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:41.960
Hmm...

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.130
You know Natsuo-kun, you have
a hard time with this area of grammar.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.540
You didn't do well on your quiz
from the day before yesterday, either.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.750
Is it maybe because you're thinking
about Ashihara-san, even during class?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:52.500
Hey!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.920
Huh?! What's that?! Ashihara-san,
as in that girl from Class 7?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.540
Natsuo-kun, are you interested in her?

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.880
I am not!

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:02.630
Even still, the two of you are often together,
and who knows what you're doing.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.750
What we're doing...?

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.880
What?! You're not actually for real
doing something with Ashihara-san...?

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.130
Nothing happened!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:14.750
All right, all right! This conversation's over!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.380
What?! Come on! Boo!

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.040
I wanna hear about fleeting tales of youth.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.540
Cut it out!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:40.580
Tell a cold lie; one that could even freeze a heart

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:41.420
That Rui just had to go and say something
unnecessary... and in front of Sensei.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:47.330
Don't give me those gentle eyes

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:49.170
Preparation • Review

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:55.790
At least, let's end this with a fleeting kiss

00:18:56.000 --> 00:19:06.250
I'm not a child, so you don't have to teach me anything anymore

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:17.710
Uncertain feelings overflow; I can't breathe

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.170
Sensei...?

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:24.420
Hey why? Hey why? Why aren't you here?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:30.960
Many times, many times, I cried out alone

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:36.790
Nothing, I don't need anything else anymore

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:44.960
If I can possess your heart then...

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:50.460
To want something that is intangible

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:58.460
Even though that is not like me

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.210
Shuu...san...

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.420
Good morning!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:20.000
Aren't you up a little late today?
You should probably hurry and get ready.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.540
I was studying for the tests until morning, so...

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:27.920
What?! Until morning?! It's fine to study hard,
but don't overdo it, okay?

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:31.420
If exhaustion sets in on the day of the tests
and you end up missing them,

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.630
then all your effort up until then
will have been for nothing.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:35.790
That would be heartbreaking, right?

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.460
Summer break!!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.460
!

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.960
Book Room

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:50.000
Good job on the final exams.

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:54.880
More than anything, it appears that everyone had scores
that would not bring shame to the Literature Club's name.

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:58.330
And now finally, we are about
to enter summer break, but...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.500
besides just your writing activities...

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.830
make sure to strive towards studying,
as that is the main duty of a student...

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:17.170
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:17.170
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.920
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:29.510
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:29.510
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:39.090
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:39.090
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:47.970
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:47.970
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:56.260
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:56.260
The easiest things become harder to do

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:00.220
Otona ni nareba

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:00.220
If I become an adult,

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:12.720
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:12.720
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:17.970
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:17.970
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:22.170
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:22.170
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:26.720
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:26.720
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:31.220
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:31.220
I can't stand it more

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:36.670
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:36.670
Don't look that way

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:43.040
Episode 8

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:43.040
Then I Don't

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:43.040
Have To Be

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:43.040
An Adult

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:41.170
Then I don't have to be an adult!
